{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為什麼又突然全校集會……？」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ar4319", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園長隨興所為……這個理由我說不出口，只能簡單安撫瀨名同學。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她看著台上的母親，眼神充滿了煩躁。", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家，早喔！」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0598", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早安～！」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "女子一同", "alt_speaker_idx": 438, "voice": "go075h", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "開場第一句話就讓瀨名同學按著眉頭不爽了。", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼，今天要很罕見地說說正經的話題囉～」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0599", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「正經的學園長也好棒啊～～～～！」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 485, "voice": "ja0102", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請再多責罵我們一點～～！」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "sa0048", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈，那是怎樣？」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ht0579", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "各務台的女生們都已經被瀨名學園長調教了。", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到同學們的反應，瀨名同學……", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ar4320", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那個眼神，現在還是不要跟她說話比較好。", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算被稱為狂犬也一點都不奇怪的凶狠。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『那麼，接下來要說正經的事了。』", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0600", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "短暫的沉默後，學園長真的很罕見地板起臉。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『最近，好像出現了把小貓丟棄在這所學校裡的罪大惡極之徒呢～』", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0601", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園長開門見山地說，底下的學生們竊竊私語起來。", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『心裡有底的人請舉手。』", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0602", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "禮堂內瞬間變得安靜無聲。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當然，沒有人舉手。", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……我相信我們學校的學生沒有會做出那種事情的人。』", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0603", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『所以，接下來我說的話，就當作是自言自語來聽吧。』", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0604", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "剛才還按著眉頭的瀨名同學，此時也認真地注視著學園長。", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『在這裡的女孩子們，很多人今後都會談一場美好的戀愛，然後生下心愛的男人的小寶寶吧。』", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0605", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『我也是那樣的。』", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0606", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『雖然那之後發生了很多事……不過對於承受劇痛從自己肚子裡生下的孩子，一定是疼愛有加的喔。』", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0607", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ar4321", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『棄養小貓的人類，或許是覺得只不過是貓而已。』", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0608", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『但是啊，如果以為這樣想能讓自己心裡好過一點，那就大錯特錯了喔。』", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0609", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『如果棄養小貓心裡還覺得無所謂的話……那個人一定是把作為一個人來說重要的東西丟棄了。』", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0610", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『人類是一種非常遲鈍的生物。』", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0611", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『只不過是貓？不對喔，棄養小貓的傢伙對人類也會做出一樣的事情。』", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0612", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『會對疼痛變得遲鈍喔。不懂生命的重量，連自己的生命也不珍惜的人類……』", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0613", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園長為了我們站在講台上。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "直率的，和瀨名同學一樣直來直往的話語戳入我的胸口。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "禮堂裡保持安靜的大家一定也跟我有相同的感受。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『我不希望從這所學校畢業的學生變成那樣的人。』", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0614", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『覺得我是空有理想也沒關係。』", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0615", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『但是……』", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0616", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『你們從這裡畢業過了幾年、幾十年後也可以。』", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0617", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『我希望當你們成為父親和母親的時候，能夠想起我的自言自語就好了。』", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0618", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……以上。不好意思講了這麼久。我的話說完了。』", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "rk0619", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後，瀨名學園長乾脆地離開講台。", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使過了好一會，禮堂裡也沒有人發出聲音。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……什麼嘛，耍什麼帥啊。」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ar4322", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我身旁的瀨名同學打破沉默，轉身背對我。", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的背影，和學園長非常相似。", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天早上的全校集會，一定是為了我們而召開的吧。」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，太突然了，我嚇了一跳。」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1105", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這一天，我們直到放學後都在聊學園長的話題。", "text_idx": 491, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感覺經過這次的事件，學園長的粉絲又要增加了。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也是其中一個。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是說出來的話好像會惹瀨名同學不高興，所以我只在心中承認。", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「希望這樣一來，今後不會再有人棄養貓了……」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是，能這樣的話就好了……」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1106", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～嚕～」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "pn0352", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我已經不想再看到美羽學姊悲傷的樣子了。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她那雙傷痕累累的手，更讓我加深了這個想法。", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，對了，新吾君，你明天有時間嗎？」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1107", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有，明天沒什麼事……」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那下午要不要來我家？我想答謝你之前在我生病時照顧……」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1108", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然說是答謝，但也沒辦法做什麼厲害的事就是了♪」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1109", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊突然的邀約讓我愣住了。", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這不是在作夢吧？", "text_idx": 492, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我居然被邀請去學姊家……", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，你不用太緊張喔。我的家人都不嚴肅，輕鬆一點沒關係。」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1110", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是嗎？」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，如果是新吾君，一定可以跟我媽媽也相處得融洽的～」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1111", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我有點意外。", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為學姊看起來就是個大小姐，給人家教很嚴厲的印象。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼樣呢？如果新吾君不排斥的話……」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1112", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我完全不排斥。不會給妳添麻煩的話，請讓我去打擾。」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的？謝謝你♪」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1113", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～嚕～♪」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "pn0353", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的這個笑容，讓我都想答謝她了呢。", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，太猛了。愛理的媽媽，棒透了！」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1235", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊～安潔也覺得好猛啊！不愧是愛理同學的母親呢！」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag3416", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名家到底要讓安潔著迷到什麼程度才甘心啊？」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag3417", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理的媽媽，好棒。」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "sk1295", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不、不要再誇了啦，好不舒服。」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ar4323", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過瀨名同學看起來其實很高興。", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「接下來就是必須找到願意領養小新吾的飼主了。」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1114", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "pn0354", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾跟熊喵靠著彼此，睡得很舒服的樣子。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "貓的睡臉真的好療癒喔。", "text_idx": 490, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "光是看著內心就產生了幸福的感覺。", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，認識的人都問過了吧？」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ar4324", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊，要在結女裡找飼主可能比較難了。」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1236", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我有去詢問媽媽認識的人了，希望那邊能有好的答覆……」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1115", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看來我也去問問親戚之類的比較好。」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ar4325", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔也會努力去問♪」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag3418", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我也……」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉，等一下！」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1237", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……？」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ar4326", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了，紗凪？」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ar4327", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所有人都不解地看著她。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個，新吾……啊，是指貓喔。我可以領養嗎……」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1238", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小紗凪，妳是說……」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1116", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊，抱歉。我好像已經對新吾放太多感情了……」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1239", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪對學姊深深地低下頭。", "text_idx": 483, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果紗凪可以我是沒意見啦……」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ar4328", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「讓小紗同學領養的話，大家也能放心呢！」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag3419", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃呢？」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ar4329", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「非常放心。」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "sk1296", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然我也不反對，但是美羽學姊的表情卻有一層陰影。", "text_idx": 498, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊覺得呢？」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我……」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1117", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她看了紗凪一眼，然後又沉默。", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "怎麼回事？如果是紗凪，應該能放心交給她才對……", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊，拜託妳！我真的很喜歡新吾！」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1240", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請讓我養新吾吧！」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1241", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1118", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊！」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1242", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "兩人沉默地看著對方。", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後紗凪率先點點頭，一會後美羽學姊也同樣點點頭。", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那麼，新吾就交給小紗凪了，可以嗎？」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "mu1119", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝妳！我會很疼愛牠的！」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1243", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到紗凪這麼開心，我也感到高興。", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熊喵抱歉喔。新吾就由我來給牠幸福了。」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1244", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～嚕～♪」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "pn0355", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ar4330", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就在大家都開開心心的時候，我發現瀨名同學一臉複雜的表情。", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了，瀨名同學？」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，沒事，什麼都沒有。」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ar4331", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……？」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": "ar4332", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂、欸！等一下啦，那邊的！」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1245", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一個人走在回家的路上，聽見背後傳來急促的腳步聲。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看到你超級寂寞的背影，忍不住就開口叫你了。」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1246", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，因為櫻乃和瀨名同學一起回家了。身為哥哥實在有點寂寞。」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿～活該！你就這樣孤獨死比較好。」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1247", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪把黑貓裝在社團備品的籠子裡，很慎重地抱著。", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳剛才跑著過來，新吾有沒有嚇到？」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，是嗎？新吾，抱歉喔～」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1248", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "黒猫", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咪～咪～」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "黑貓", "alt_speaker_idx": 499, "voice": "bc0024", "char_id": "黒猫"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "從籠子的小窗看著新吾，紗凪露出了笑容。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過，我真的嚇了一跳。沒想到紗凪會這麼喜歡新吾……」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對人類新吾倒是完全不喜歡。」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1249", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這部分，只要妳好好愛貓咪新吾就夠了。」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用你說我也會疼牠疼到骨子裡的！」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1250", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想起紗凪在社團中與新吾的互動，我覺得她說的一點也沒有誇張。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "希望她不要太寵貓，結果讓貓變得不受控……", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～對了，新吾，明天有空嗎？」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1251", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果有時間的話，陪我去買東西……」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1252", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，抱歉。明天美羽學姊邀我去她家……」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "話才剛出口，我立刻驚覺不妙。", "text_idx": 489, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這件事應該不要告訴紗凪才對。", "text_idx": 493, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是嗎，這樣啊。」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1253", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我已經做好了被飛踢的覺悟，但紗凪卻冷靜到讓我害怕。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這該不會就是所謂的暴風雨前的寧靜……", "text_idx": 494, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是對美羽學姊做出奇怪的事情我不會放過你。」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1254", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 157, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「反正一個人去買東西還比較輕鬆～」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1255", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 158, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然是想叫你來幫忙提東西啦。」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1256", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 159, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她沒有像以前一樣對美羽學姊的事情做出激烈反應。", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 160, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不禁思考起她的心境到底起了什麼變化。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 161, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，那我要回家和新吾卿卿我我了～」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1257", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 162, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我也和美羽學姊……」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 467, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 163, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你這傢伙，殺了你喔！」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "sn1258", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 164, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……心境的變化，我完全感覺不到。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
